<title>USA: Sports Time buys Access Communications.</title>
<headline>Sports Time buys Access Communications.</headline>
<dateline>CARSON, Calif 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sports Time Inc said it agreed to buy 85 percent of Access Communications Inc for an undisclosed amount.</p>
<p>Access is a marketer of telecommunications services. The deal is scheduled to close on November 8, 1996.</p>
</text>
